rl":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on Firefox 155 and Chromium 152 (Linux), it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- Using **Download Backup** in the project manager doesn't use the same file name as **Project > Tools > Download Project Source** in the editor:\r\n\r\n```\r\nantialiasing_2026-09-22_19-17-51.zip  <-- \"Pack Project as ZIP\" from editor\r\nantialiasing.zip                      <-- \"Download Backup\" from project manager\r\n```\r\n\r\nThese should probably be harmonized to behave the same. (In this example, both files are already identical bit-for-bit.)\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\nAs an aside, we should hide the current **Pack Project as ZIP** option in the web editor, as it can't write outside the virtual filesystem and isn't very useful as a result. In its place, we should move **Download Project Source** (and perhaps rename it to **Pack Project as ZIP** for UX consistency).\r\n\r\n- **Edit:** The above is being done by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123525, although it doesn't hide the original **Pack Project as ZIP** option.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123149#pullrequestreview-5281382356","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123149","auth